WEBVTT

00:03.169 --> 00:03.760
Stay back!

00:12.846 --> 00:14.780
R-Rumina...!

00:29.362 --> 00:30.522
Rumina!

00:34.434 --> 00:36.095
No!

00:37.837 --> 00:38.804
Wh-What the...?!

00:51.351 --> 00:52.579
I see.

00:52.652 --> 00:54.916
So this is her power
of resurrection!

00:55.488 --> 00:57.888
This is it!

01:02.662 --> 01:05.893
The energy is flowing
to where the Wind User has fallen.

01:16.743 --> 01:18.335
This is amazing!

01:45.138 --> 01:50.474
HEY YOU!
If you keep sulking and
watch the world go by

01:51.244 --> 01:56.113
Nothing will ever happen
So don't run away

01:56.816 --> 02:02.948
If you have a future
that you can run to

02:03.022 --> 02:09.086
There's no time to be depressed

02:09.362 --> 02:15.426
Everyone gets lost
from time to time

02:15.502 --> 02:21.372
But we keep living
every day that we are granted

02:21.441 --> 02:27.573
Things that we must not lose

02:27.647 --> 02:33.677
We must protect
even if we get hurt

02:33.753 --> 02:39.919
Still we can believe
in our strength

02:39.993 --> 02:46.626
To be able to get up
and walk again

02:54.374 --> 02:58.144
Frustration - Unfulfilled Desire
Frustration - Unfulfilled Desire.

02:58.144 --> 03:01.113
Frustration - Unfulfilled Desire

03:10.557 --> 03:11.546
It's warm.

03:12.759 --> 03:17.025
A warm light
is enveloping my body.

03:28.975 --> 03:33.207
This is the same feeling I had when I was
saved by Ruri on the surface.

03:43.723 --> 03:44.690
Ruri...

03:58.705 --> 04:01.833
I guess I've been saved again...

04:04.777 --> 04:06.369
My wound is healed.

04:07.146 --> 04:08.272
How dare I...

04:12.352 --> 04:14.786
How dare I tell her I would
show her the stars!

04:14.954 --> 04:17.548
How could I make a promise
like that...

04:17.624 --> 04:19.421
...when I can't even be there
to hold her hand!

04:43.449 --> 04:44.575
Excuse me.

04:51.758 --> 04:52.747
Maiden?

05:07.940 --> 05:12.036
My selfishness is the cause of
everyone disappearing.

05:13.079 --> 05:16.446
If I'd known... I would've just
stayed here in the first place.

05:17.050 --> 05:18.813
Don't you believe that.

05:26.826 --> 05:27.622
Chelsea!

05:28.561 --> 05:31.689
If you had stayed here
the whole time...

05:31.764 --> 05:35.461
...you never would've met
that little punk.

05:36.202 --> 05:36.896
Um...

05:37.704 --> 05:40.195
Let's think more positively.

05:48.114 --> 05:51.345
Ruri, I will definitely protect you!

05:57.957 --> 06:01.484
The reason for parting is so
we can reunite.

06:01.961 --> 06:03.690
Time never stops.

06:04.731 --> 06:08.167
So, don't lose heart.
Keep your chin up...

06:08.634 --> 06:10.625
...and keep marching forward.

06:17.076 --> 06:19.237
I know that you can do it.

06:24.384 --> 06:25.442
Chel...

06:28.888 --> 06:30.480
Is something the matter?

06:32.759 --> 06:33.384
No.

06:34.093 --> 06:35.822
It's nothing...

06:51.711 --> 06:55.272
I've been waiting for you,
Lord Kashin.

07:15.168 --> 07:18.934
The fight against the resistance
is currently...

07:19.272 --> 07:20.830
What's going on with Sarasa?

07:21.174 --> 07:22.539
Before we get to that...

07:22.809 --> 07:24.003
I want to see her.

07:26.612 --> 07:27.704
I understand.

07:34.420 --> 07:35.352
Sis!

07:35.655 --> 07:36.644
Where are you?!

07:47.166 --> 07:48.155
Chelsea...

07:53.306 --> 07:54.364
Chelsea!

08:14.160 --> 08:16.390
Were you hurt, Sarasa?

08:20.833 --> 08:21.857
I heard...

08:22.635 --> 08:25.103
...that you tried to leave
the Company again.

08:26.639 --> 08:30.700
The surface world is too filthy
a place for you.

08:30.843 --> 08:33.437
It'll just be for a
little while longer.

08:33.579 --> 08:34.568
Then...

08:42.722 --> 08:44.349
Has someone been cutting her hair?

08:44.657 --> 08:45.180
Yes.

08:45.825 --> 08:48.521
The hairdresser comes in
once a month.

08:48.594 --> 08:50.323
Don't have her hair cut anymore.

08:57.370 --> 08:59.531
My sister's hair was long.

09:01.140 --> 09:02.903
I hate to see you look so sad.

09:04.544 --> 09:06.341
Was someone mean to you?

09:07.413 --> 09:08.402
Just tell me.

09:08.714 --> 09:11.342
Anyone who tries to hurt you,
Sarasa...

09:11.417 --> 09:14.079
...I'll be sure to kill.

09:27.600 --> 09:29.932
Where are you going,
Lord Kashin?

09:46.118 --> 09:48.143
Where are you, sis?!

09:50.423 --> 09:51.287
Kashin...

09:51.857 --> 09:52.789
Where are you?

09:59.865 --> 10:00.923
Kashin...

10:02.602 --> 10:03.432
Sis!

10:04.437 --> 10:05.768
I'm sorry.

10:06.138 --> 10:10.199
The sister that you remember
no longer exists.

10:12.445 --> 10:13.912
Is this where you were, sis?

10:24.557 --> 10:25.353
Please.

10:25.925 --> 10:27.290
Please kill me.

10:30.296 --> 10:32.992
Please kill me
with your own hands.

10:34.033 --> 10:35.022
N-No way!

10:35.768 --> 10:36.757
Kashin...

10:37.937 --> 10:39.734
How could I do such a thing?!

10:40.473 --> 10:42.100
I can't do that!

10:42.875 --> 10:44.365
No way! No way!

10:44.577 --> 10:46.340
No way!

11:07.199 --> 11:08.496
How careless.

11:08.567 --> 11:12.128
How could he touch me,
even for an instant?

11:22.114 --> 11:24.105
If I let this go any further...

11:24.183 --> 11:26.674
...it'll pose a big threat
to my plans.

11:35.528 --> 11:37.996
There's a scratch on Sarasa's face.

11:38.397 --> 11:39.489
What happened?

11:40.332 --> 11:42.425
May I offer a suggestion,
Lord Kashin?

11:42.501 --> 11:45.026
Making the Company's
first priority...

11:45.104 --> 11:48.540
...the protection of the Maiden
when we're facing threats from...

11:51.911 --> 11:53.276
I won't accept any excuses.

11:54.480 --> 11:56.141
I'm not making excuses.

11:59.819 --> 12:04.153
Do you want a matching scar
on your other cheek?

12:36.188 --> 12:38.053
You won't get another chance.

12:42.628 --> 12:46.621
We'll see who doesn't get
another chance.

13:06.318 --> 13:07.250
Ruri...

13:11.390 --> 13:13.551
The last time I saw you laugh
was so long ago...

13:13.626 --> 13:16.094
...and it's been nothing but tears
since then.

13:16.762 --> 13:18.389
So much has happened
since the school rooftop...

13:18.731 --> 13:20.198
...at Tower Gate...

13:35.548 --> 13:36.981
What the heck am I doing?!

13:37.616 --> 13:40.642
Didn't I come here
to take Ruri back?!

13:41.020 --> 13:44.183
She is the first girl I've ever
held hands with after all!

13:45.391 --> 13:46.255
I get it...

13:48.828 --> 13:51.763
That's why she doesn't want me
to look at her sad face.

13:53.032 --> 13:54.465
Then why?

13:58.737 --> 14:01.672
Why couldn't you save her?!

14:02.641 --> 14:03.369
Wha...?!

14:03.442 --> 14:05.307
She was standing right
in front of you!

14:06.812 --> 14:08.143
Why couldn't you save her?!

14:09.882 --> 14:10.678
Look!

14:17.289 --> 14:18.347
I can sense it!

14:18.424 --> 14:22.258
I sense that you're becoming more
significant to Ruri with every passing day!

14:23.629 --> 14:25.119
What's going on with you?!

14:25.331 --> 14:28.732
That is why I can't forgive
your cowardliness!

14:29.602 --> 14:33.129
Ruri did not ask me to save her.

14:33.305 --> 14:35.136
But she called out to you!

14:45.351 --> 14:47.876
Doesn't he know it's dinnertime?

14:47.953 --> 14:49.887
What's taking Rumina so long?

14:50.089 --> 14:53.752
How long does Miss Rorec
intend on taking a walk for?

14:54.827 --> 14:56.488
I think I'll go and find her.

14:57.329 --> 14:58.091
Emilia?

14:58.664 --> 14:59.358
Emilia!

15:00.699 --> 15:02.530
Don't you know it's dinnertime?

15:02.801 --> 15:03.790
Oh, sorry.

15:06.438 --> 15:08.372
I'm not feeling too hungry.

15:14.046 --> 15:15.479
Rumina got hurt...

15:17.049 --> 15:18.983
The Maiden shed tears...

15:20.019 --> 15:24.251
...and Pairon wore an expression
I'd never seen before.

15:25.691 --> 15:30.890
If what Miss Chelsea was saying about
the Company was even partly true...

15:31.630 --> 15:34.827
...then what have we been
believing in all this time?

15:35.935 --> 15:36.799
Don't be silly.

15:38.037 --> 15:41.905
At the very least, we love the
Underground.

15:42.041 --> 15:45.033
And we're trying to make it
a better place.

15:45.177 --> 15:49.409
Whatever the Company may be,
how we feel doesn't change.

15:49.782 --> 15:50.806
Isn't that right?

15:51.583 --> 15:52.914
Jilherts...

15:53.819 --> 15:56.549
If you understand now,
how about getting dinner ready?

15:56.622 --> 15:57.589
Uh, right!

15:58.324 --> 16:01.953
Fancy words, but you just want to
get out of setting the table.

16:08.200 --> 16:11.033
I will go and find Miss Rorec.

16:11.337 --> 16:11.996
Okay!

16:14.606 --> 16:16.233
You're horrible, Jilherts.

16:20.579 --> 16:21.637
Why, you...

16:31.523 --> 16:32.455
But...!

16:32.524 --> 16:34.583
But the biggest coward is me!

16:37.129 --> 16:38.687
I got so close to Ruri!

16:39.231 --> 16:41.631
My only mission in life
was to protect Ruri!

16:42.167 --> 16:44.294
But I couldn't do anything!

16:59.218 --> 17:00.310
Miss Rorec...?

17:04.390 --> 17:05.482
Th-That's...

17:07.960 --> 17:09.154
Enough!

17:18.270 --> 17:19.999
What?
You want to keep going?

17:22.574 --> 17:23.404
Thank you.

17:23.809 --> 17:24.400
Huh?

17:25.744 --> 17:26.972
I feel much better.

17:34.086 --> 17:35.815
She's so hard to get along with.

17:35.888 --> 17:37.150
Hey, you!

17:37.523 --> 17:39.650
What did you do to Miss Rorec?!

17:39.892 --> 17:40.381
Huh?

17:41.560 --> 17:42.891
It was nothing.

17:43.128 --> 17:44.823
What do you mean?!

17:46.165 --> 17:48.793
Well, let's just say
we worked out a few things.

17:49.334 --> 17:50.164
What?

18:01.080 --> 18:02.672
So that's the story.

18:04.049 --> 18:06.916
I want you to go after the one
who poisoned the maiden's mind...

18:06.985 --> 18:09.852
...the criminal who took her
to the surface...

18:09.922 --> 18:13.653
...and the two uninvited guests
from the surface.

18:14.493 --> 18:16.188
You want me
to eliminate them?

18:17.429 --> 18:20.364
You understand
very well, Korin.

18:21.366 --> 18:25.132
I am on the verge
of becoming a Class A warrior.

18:25.304 --> 18:29.536
One or two surface dwellers
are nothing to me.

18:30.042 --> 18:31.031
I suppose.

18:31.276 --> 18:34.575
For one worthy of becoming
a Class A warrior, that is.

18:35.180 --> 18:36.704
I look forward to it.

18:40.052 --> 18:41.644
Excuse me, Pairon.

18:44.523 --> 18:47.219
Class A warrior, huh?

18:56.201 --> 18:58.101
That's right.
I'm going to get stronger.

18:58.504 --> 18:59.664
Just like Kashin.

19:00.038 --> 19:01.335
Stronger than Suijen...

19:06.812 --> 19:07.744
Or even Seki...

19:12.918 --> 19:14.044
Pairon, huh?

19:28.233 --> 19:29.131
Let's go.

19:29.201 --> 19:29.826
Yeah.

19:30.536 --> 19:32.902
Why would you two
come with us?

19:32.971 --> 19:35.667
Well, as officers of the Company...

19:35.741 --> 19:39.177
...we have a duty to monitor
you and Miss Rorec.

19:39.511 --> 19:41.376
That's what you say...

19:41.446 --> 19:44.506
...but maybe you just want
to be close to Chelsea.

19:44.783 --> 19:45.545
That's right.

19:45.984 --> 19:48.475
I'm going to be monitoring
Miss Rorec...

19:48.554 --> 19:50.886
...and always keep
my eyes on her!

19:50.956 --> 19:51.786
Always?

19:51.857 --> 19:53.188
All the time?

19:54.793 --> 19:55.953
Oh, my! I don't know if I can handle it?!

19:56.028 --> 19:58.963
- What's going on in her mind?
- Oh, my! This is too much!

19:59.831 --> 20:00.820
And...

20:01.767 --> 20:03.962
I want to make sure of something.

20:04.369 --> 20:08.032
I want to see for myself
if what you say is true.

20:09.174 --> 20:09.936
Hey!

20:10.008 --> 20:11.066
We're going!

20:11.143 --> 20:13.543
Hey! Don't you even think
of running away!

20:13.612 --> 20:15.409
Don't be stupid!

20:25.257 --> 20:26.519
I found you...

20:44.409 --> 20:49.278
Again, I walk the streets today

20:49.348 --> 20:55.253
As if I have a purpose

20:55.320 --> 21:07.357
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:08.500 --> 21:19.206
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.278 --> 21:30.849
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.657 --> 21:40.656
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.732 --> 21:44.429
I tried to listen

21:44.503 --> 21:52.603
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.678 --> 22:00.915
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.362 --> 22:12.296
Preview

22:13.999 --> 22:17.298
Hey!
What're you doing, Blondie?!

22:17.636 --> 22:21.470
We came all the way out here
so we wouldn't be caught!

22:21.540 --> 22:24.805
And here you are getting caught
in some obvious trap!

22:25.410 --> 22:28.106
Well, maybe you can just
sit tight and watch.

22:28.180 --> 22:31.274
If this is my opponent,
I can handle it myself!

22:32.117 --> 22:34.449
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:34.519 --> 22:35.954
..."The Trap of the Magnet Users."

22:35.954 --> 22:37.589
The Trap of the Magnet Users
..."The Trap of the Magnet Users."

22:37.589 --> 22:40.251
The Trap of the Magnet Users
